{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>The burnt-offering of the sabbath on its sabbath.</b> That is, on every sabbath; and שבתו is like (Exodus 5:13) ״דבר יום ביומו״ — 'the task of each day on its day.' <b>Beside the continual burnt-offering.</b> That is, the continual burnt-offering first, and afterward the burnt-offering of the sabbath."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:36:40.196450868Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}